{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Smart ARC arc menu:** Smoothly open apps and system tools through screen-edge gestures.\n- **Split screen & floating windows:** Supports opening apps as floating windows or in 3-screen mode; automatically adjusts corner radius, shadows, Notch spacing and display position.\n- **Layer customization & shortcut hierarchy:** Flexible 1 to 4 layer hierarchy for both the app list and the toolbar; customize button radius and size.\n- **Quick system actions:** Built-in shortcuts for Rotation Lock, Screenshot/Screen Recording, clearing background apps, Respring, Wi-Fi On/Off, Flashlight, Lock Screen and Light/Dark mode.\n- **Optimized user experience:** Haptic feedback, touch sounds, automatically hides ARC when taking screenshots/recordings, and keeps the window centered.\n- **Convenient configuration management:** Back up, restore, export/import custom configuration files or quickly reset to default.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
